<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 44.001B "S" Curve without a Table</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Steele, Norman W; Seattle F Design, Apr 75</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Same as 44.001C except orientation of stone relative to</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">the transfer axis 96-48.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 2.420</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">20 facets + 10 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">1-fold symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.687</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.451 C/W = 0.182</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.347</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="410">pc44001b.asc</tspan>
</text>
